Package: multiSPC
Type: Package
Title: Univariate and Multivariate Statistical Process Control
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Jean-Michel", "Galharret",
           email = "jean-michel.galharret@oniris-nantes.fr",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Edgar", "Santos-Fernandez", role = "ctb",
           comment = "datasets, from the MSQC package")
    )
Description: Tools for teaching and applying statistical process control:
    estimation of process parameters, Shewhart and exponentially weighted
    moving average (EWMA) control charts, capability indices, and
    multivariate control charts, including Hotelling T2 charts for
    subgrouped and individual data, the Mason-Young-Tracy decomposition,
    multivariate EWMA, generalized variance and charts on principal
    components. Methods are described in Montgomery (2019,
    ISBN:978-1-119-39930-8) and Santos-Fernandez (2012)
    <doi:10.1007/978-1-4614-5453-3>.
